     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-size:13px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Hi D-RUGGies,</font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><br>Tomorrow we&#39;ll have a presentation from Kate Tiedeman on using the <b>raster</b> package in R. There&#39;s some great expertise and info that can be shared for those that work on spatial data (vector or raster), so we are hoping to get some material out to you all.</font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><br></font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:13px\">We&#39;ll be screencasting the event, so if you want to chat or watch live (or later), see the video on youtube <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mHz4wxo-Q4U\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DmHz4wxo-Q4U&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466656232000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3clthfXms6aRMhHIgRw41O\">HERE</a>.</font><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><br></font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:13px\">I&#39;ll post up materials/code after the presentation tomorrow.</font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><br></font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">And in a few weeks, I&#39;ll talk about mapmaking with RStudio (Nov 30th), which will focus a bit more on point data and vector data.</font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-size:13px\"><u><b><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">PACKAGE OF THE WEEK:</font></b></u></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-size:13px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Currently there are <b>11, 840</b> </span>total packages on <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(102,17,204);margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;text-decoration-line:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466656232000&amp;usg=AOvVaw01QKLXjEzyUJy00bENhT7b\">CRAN</a>. </font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">A glut of packages this week that are all helpful or dependent on one another for working with spatial data. If you haven&#39;t already installed the rgdal package, you&#39;ll need it for most of the spatial packages. This isn&#39;t a complete list, but the main packages I think everyone should be aware of (please add to the <a href=\"https://goo.gl/forms/VzzeldnaEOkNImJ73\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://goo.gl/forms/VzzeldnaEOkNImJ73&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466656232000&amp;usg=AOvVaw36l0fX65n7AUFPrPi6WhiF\">google form</a> for others I&#39;m missing):</font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><ul><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><b>sf</b></font></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><b>rgdal</b></font></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><b>sp</b></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><b>raster</b></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><b>ggmap</b></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><b>rgeos</b></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><b>maptools</b></li><li style=\"margin-left:15px\"><b>maps</b></li></ul></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-size:13px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">If you want to see the packages that I&#39;ve mentioned thus far this quarter, there&#39;s a <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/2PACX-1vQH6BvP8p-YZOWpYFVIJYBa8AyscYgQB0Mone8NUKhlwKAA8UfGmUoIy22CO1AHOkNTR3Q4LSu2lvVm/pubhtml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/2PACX-1vQH6BvP8p-YZOWpYFVIJYBa8AyscYgQB0Mone8NUKhlwKAA8UfGmUoIy22CO1AHOkNTR3Q4LSu2lvVm/pubhtml&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466656232000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2FsJgpPN-RWkTFT0giSAPZ\">table here</a>.</font></div></div><div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><br></font></div><div>Hope to see you all tomorrow at 10am in the Library (DSI 360).</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div>Adios,</div><div>Ryan</div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inline\"><span> </span></span><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"></b></i></font></span><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><font size=\"1\"><i>&quot;When we try to pick out anything by itself, we find it hitched to everything else in the universe.&quot;<b><br>John Muir (My First Summer in the Sierra, 1911)</b></i></font></div><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b>-----------------------------------------------------</b></i></font></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;line-height:19px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><div>Ryan Peek</div><div>PhD Candidate, Graduate Group in Ecology<br></div><div dir=\"ltr\">Center for Watershed Sciences, UC Davis</div></font></span><div style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small;